WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:10.235
Your drums, bass and chords patterns are ready. Pick one in the pattern list, then click the playlist to paint it.

2
00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:16.888
Drag a clip to move it. Hold Shift while you drag to make a copy.

3
00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:24.026
Double-click the ruler to add a marker, and double-click the marker to rename it.

4
00:00:24.538 --> 00:00:28.903
On an audio clip, drag the little handle in its top corner to fade it in.

5
00:00:29.302 --> 00:00:32.321
Press play to hear the riser build into the drop.

6
00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:40.851
And the plus in the title bar opens another project in a new tab.
